  "editorial": {
    "name": "jackall3n/postcss-scope",
    "descriptionZh": "一个小 PostCSS 插件，给每条 CSS 规则统一加前缀选择器做作用域隔离，并可用注释按规则、按文件跳过或覆盖。",
    "takeawayZh": "给 postcss-scope 传选择器，整份 CSS 加前缀。",
    "noteZh": "About 栏是「🔭 A small plugin to allow you to scope your css with a custom selector」，侧栏只列了 Readme、Activity、8 stars、1 watching、3 forks 和 Report repository，没写许可证。Languages 条显示 TypeScript 97.6% / JavaScript 2.4%，Contributors 3（jackall3n、renovate[bot]、gbale）。README 给了三种配置写法：postcss-scope 传 \".foo\"、传数组 [\".foo\", \".bar\"] 做多作用域、以及排在 tailwindcss 与 autoprefixer 之后串进 postcss.config.js；正文还演示了 `/* postcss-scope:ignore */` 跳过单条规则、`/* postcss-scope:ignore-file */` 跳过整个文件、`/* postcss-scope:.bar */` 覆盖全局选择器。",
